    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ideally positioned within The Maples, a highly regarded and well-established residential development, this attractive two-bedroom terraced house presents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors. The property offers well-proportioned and comfortable accommodation throughout, together with off-street parking to the front and gas-fired central heating. Set within a mature and popular residential setting, the property provides an excellent opportunity to create a wonderful home in a sought-after development.\r\n\r\nA particular feature of the property is the private south-west facing rear garden, which enjoys an abundance of natural light and sunshine throughout the afternoon and into the evening. The garden provides an ideal outdoor space for relaxing, entertaining or dining al fresco during the warmer months. The combination of a sunny rear garden, off-street parking, gas-fired central heating and its position within this highly regarded development makes this an appealing home with considerable potential for its new owners.\r\n\r\nThe Maples enjoys an excellent and highly convenient location, with a wide range of amenities and services all within easy reach. UCD, Montrose, RTÉ, St Vincent’s Hospital, Merrion Shopping Centre and Donnybrook Village are all close by, while Dublin city centre is readily accessible.\r\nTo the west, Deer Park, Mount Anville School, The Goat Grill and the amenities of Mount Merrion are nearby, with Dundrum Town Centre and a number of Luas stops also within easy reach. Stillorgan Village is a short distance to the south and provides a further excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and educational facilities.\r\n\r\nThe development itself is particularly appealing to families, with substantial areas of mature green space providing plenty of room for children to play and residents to enjoy the outdoors. There are also two communal tennis courts within the development, adding to the excellent range of recreational amenities available on the doorstep.\r\n\r\nCombined with its established setting and convenient location close to schools, shopping facilities, transport links and Dublin city centre, The Maples is a highly regarded residential development in which to live."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation \r\n\r\nEntrance Porch\r\nDouble-glazed PVC entrance door, tiled floor and glass-panelled door leading to:\r\n\r\nLiving Room – approx. 5.4m x 3.8m\r\nSpacious and bright living room featuring ceiling cornice and centre rose, attractive marble fireplace and hearth with gas coal-effect fire, together with useful understairs storage.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Room – approx. 4.6m x 3.8m\r\nFitted kitchen with a range of built-in cupboards and drawers, integrated oven and four-ring gas hob. Plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher. Parquet flooring and double-glazed sliding doors leading to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\n\r\nLanding - Access to attic storage.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 – approx. 3.8m x 3.0m\r\nDouble bedroom with a range of built-in wardrobes and vanity unit.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 – approx. 3.8m x 3.4m\r\nDouble bedroom with built-in wardrobe and attractive porthole window.\r\n\r\nBathroom – approx. 3.0m x 1.7m\r\nWC, wash hand basin and fully tiled bath with Triton shower unit. Shelved hot press.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\n\r\nRear Garden\r\nPrivate, fully walled, south-west facing rear garden, laid mainly in lawn with a paved patio area and Barna-style shed. The garden enjoys excellent afternoon and evening sunshine.\r\n\r\nFront Garden\r\nCobblelock front garden providing off-street parking for two cars."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Special Features\r\n\r\nTwo-bedroom terraced house\r\nSouth-west facing rear garden\r\nOff-street parking for two cars\r\nGas-fired central heating\r\nDouble-glazed windows\r\nBeautiful sylvan setting\r\nWired for alarm\r\nTwo communal tennis courts within the development\r\nExcellent location close to UCD\r\nConvenient to a wide range of amenities and public transport\r\nApprox 70 sq mt / 753 sq ft"
      },
